@AseraBackend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5086

### List all tenants
GET {{AseraBackend_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Accept: application/json

### Get one tenant
GET {{AseraBackend_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a tenant
POST {{AseraBackend_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Riverside Presbyterian",
  "domain": "riverside",
  "faxEnabled": false,
  "corporate": false,
  "status": "Active",
  "startDate": "2026-11-26",
  "endDate": "2027-11-26",
  "graceDays": 30,
  "packages": ["Women's Health|OB", "Women's Health|MFM"],
  "notifications": { "enabled": true }
}

### Update subscription
PUT {{AseraBackend_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/1/subscription
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Active",
  "startDate": "2025-11-09",
  "endDate": "2027-11-09",
  "graceDays": 45,
  "packages": ["Women's Health|OB"],
  "notifications": { "enabled": false }
}

### Cancel a tenant
POST {{AseraBackend_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/1/cancel
